  "about": "« Entre tes agents » as rules (Alex 21/11, piste A). Each case: this place's agents (`family`: the family's agent; `project`: a project agent, shown to friends; `can_share`: false for one that can't share folders), the households linked, the rules as GET /v1/agent-rules gives them (`write`, `pairs`, `read`, `reads`, `aside`, `family`, `households`), and what they allow: `links` (writer, recipient) and `reads` (reader, source), sorted; `may_write` spot checks [from, to, allowed]; `ways` the state of each way with a household (off | waiting | proposed | agreed | declined). Another household's agent is `agent__household`. The bridge's tests replay every case (bridge-rs/src/rules.rs `the_contract_cases`); the apps reuse them for their screens.",
